; 京东 QuanX 测试 — converted from Egern/jd.yaml (url_rewrites 3 + body_rewrites 1, no rules section in source)
; FLAG: source entry 3 was Egern reject-video; Quantumult X has no reject-video in the docs snapshot -> closest documented equivalent reject-img used.
hostname = api.m.jd.com, *.360buyimg.com
^https?://api\.m\.jd\.com/client\.action\?(?:[^#]*&)?functionId=queryPagePopWindow(?:&[^#]*)?$ url reject-dict
^https?://[^/]+\.360buyimg\.com/mobilecms/s1\d{3}x2\d{3}_jfs/ url reject-img
^https?://[^/]*360buyimg\.com/material-video/ url reject-img
^https?://api\.m\.jd\.com/client\.action\?(?:[^#]*&)?functionId=start(?:&[^#]*)?$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ioreal4me/iOS/main/test/quanx-jd.js
